{"id":"steam-1016780","steam":1016780,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Orange Island","summary":"Explore a pastel-hued island while uncovering mysteries from the past. Orange Island is an authentic 8-bit action-adventure game with heart.","about":"Orange Island is a new single-player 8-bit action-adventure platformer game being developed by Ted Sterchi. This game is being carefully developed to be a completely authentic retro experience, fully created under the graphic and audio specifications of the NES. In fact, we're even creating a homebrew NES port!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n•  6+ hours of gameplay with vast areas built for non-linear exploration\r\n•  A touching and timely story told via cutscenes and conversations\r\n•  Five playable characters with individual magical abilities and stats\r\n•  8-bit graphics, chiptune audio, and gameplay authentic to the NES\r\n•  A unique pastel pixel art style\r\n•  Engaging puzzles with retro side-scrolling platformer mechanics\r\n•  Side-quests and activities to complete in numerous towns, inns, and shops\r\n•  No microtransactions, loot boxes, or gambling nonsense\r\n•  \"Shoot-em-up” sequences with classic spaceship combat\r\n•  Guest compositions from Hiroki Kikuta, Soyo Oka, Lena Raine, and more! 🎵","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016780/portrait.png?t=1688947338","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016780/header.jpg?t=1688947338","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016780/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1688947338","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016780/header.jpg?t=1688947338","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016780/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1688947338","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016780/ss_cecb376e1a2e434e9de17d670f7a625b5b983ba7